---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Us — GFR Calculator"
	description="About GFR Calculator: why we built a free, transparent eGFR calculator with step-by-step math and no sign-up required."
>
	<article class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
			<p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-mute">About Us</p>
			<h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">About GFR Calculator</h1>

			<p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				GFR Calculator is a free, open online tool for estimating glomerular filtration rate
				(eGFR) using the CKD-EPI 2021, CKD-EPI 2009, MDRD, and Cockcroft-Gault equations. We built
				it after reading a peer-reviewed study showing that nearly one in five freely available
				online GFR calculators produced erroneous, clinically misleading results.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Why we built this</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				Most online medical calculators are black boxes: you enter numbers, a result appears, and
				there is no way to check the arithmetic. We wanted something different — a calculator that
				shows its work. Every result on this site displays the full formula with your actual
				numbers substituted in, so you or your clinician can verify the calculation by hand rather
				than trusting an opaque number.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">What makes this calculator different</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				<li>Unit conversion between mg/dL and &micro;mol/L is centralized in one tested function, addressing a documented source of error in other calculators.</li>
				<li>No race-based adjustment is applied to any formula, in line with the 2021 NKF/ASN recommendation.</li>
				<li>Every formula clearly states its output unit — mL/min/1.73m&sup2; for the eGFR equations, or mL/min for Cockcroft-Gault.</li>
				<li>All calculations run in your browser. Your inputs are never sent to a server. See our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-link hover:text-link-deep">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</li>
				<li>No account, sign-up, or paywall — the calculator is free to use.</li>
			</ul>

			<p class="mt-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				Read more about the formulas and the research behind our design choices on the
				<a href="/methodology" class="text-link hover:text-link-deep">methodology</a> page.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Not a substitute for medical advice</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				This tool is for educational and informational purposes only. It does not provide medical
				advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and it is not a substitute for consulting a qualified
				healthcare professional about your kidney function or any medical condition.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Get in touch</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
				Questions, corrections, or feedback are welcome on our
				<a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:text-link-deep">Contact Us</a> page.
			</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
